{"id":"en_why-the-woman-awakens","title":"Why the Woman Awakens","titleEn":"Why the Woman Awakens","description":"Fiona Tucker, a rural woman, found herself cast out by her son and his relatives following a theft accusation. She later met and wed Joel Griffin. Meanwhile, Sarah, an in-law, had been deceiving Henry, Fiona's son, into believing she was the one who donated a kidney to him and financed their home. Even after Fiona left, Sarah kept finding ways to degrade her, at one point sending her to the hospital. Throughout it all, Joel remained at Fiona's side, shielding her, until he persuaded her to put her own wellbeing ahead of her son's. Viewers can follow this series on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/why-the-woman-awakens/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/why-the-woman-awakens/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Billionaire","Secret Identity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmhdw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_why-the-woman-awakens_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmhdw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_why-the-woman-awakens_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmhdw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_why-the-woman-awakens_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cmhdw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_why-the-woman-awakens_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/